text = "[u]Colt was last seen at the DIT lobby at 6:00 PM, where he parted ways with four people. By 8:00 PM, professors spotted him roaming the department parking lot, acting highly paranoid, looking around constantly, and seemingly hiding from something. While a check of the department between 8:00 PM and 9:00 PM confirmed the area was completely empty, Colt was spotted one last time crying at 9:47 PM right before he vanished. There are currently no active traces of his whereabouts. [/u]"
